    "body": "I understand where I wasn't clear in my questioning.\n\n> At no point does this mention what the getEnabledState algorithm should be\n\nHere I mean \"the closewatcher construction steps do not define what the _given_ `getEnabledState` is\", leaving it open for interpretation if it is `[]() -> bool { return true; }` or `[]() -> bool { return false; }`",
