    "body": "> Yes, but it's not being supplied for `new CloserWatcher()` at the moment. [@keithamus](https://github.com/keithamus) is politely pointing out that [8029d4f](https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/8029d4f2782f78fd23540484d960f8ba25798600) introduced a regression.\n\nI did indeed miss this entire point of this issue, and misread it as \"that `getEnabledState` thing is confusing\". Sorry about that!\n\n> [domenic](https://github.com/domenic) closed this as [completed](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues?q=is%3Aissue%20state%3Aclosed%20archived%3Afalse%20reason%3Acompleted) in [d035517](https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/d03551713db25c3a7bd8020112f06bf7ce1c9a1e) [3 days ago](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10920#event-16006029473)\n\nThanks to @domenic for fixing my bug!\n",
